  "title": "The d, k, m, n and p Rows",
  "short": "Each row is one consonant with the five vowels: da de di do du, ka ke ki ko ku, and so on.",
  "trouble": "Students expect signs in one row to look alike. Signs that share a consonant usually look nothing like each other; you learn them one by one.",
